{"id":"CTB-0xy","title":"VPN requirement for bridge access","description":"Require VPN (Tailscale or WireGuard) connection to home network before bridge is reachable. Network-level security layer independent of application auth. Motivated by broader infosec/activist threat model.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","created_at":"2026-02-13T19:28:16.135683-07:00","updated_at":"2026-02-15T21:53:45.122698-07:00","closed_at":"2026-02-15T21:53:45.122698-07:00"}
{"id":"CTB-22q","title":"General message rate limiting / debounce","description":"Rate limit incoming Telegram messages before passing to Claude. Options: simple cooldown (2-3 sec between messages), or smarter debounce (batch rapid messages into one Claude invocation). Protects against accidental floods, keeps API costs predictable, and adds a basic security layer independent of OTP auth.","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","created_at":"2026-02-13T19:46:57.767558-07:00","updated_at":"2026-02-13T19:46:57.767558-07:00"}
